Mark Task 4.1 as DONE in PLAN.md.
```

#### Task 4.2 — Cloud DB & RLS Migrations
```
Read PLAN.md. Implement Task 4.2:

Create /supabase/migrations/001_initial_schema.sql: all CREATE TABLE
statements from the plan + indexes on patient_code, doctor_id,
session_id, status.

Create /supabase/migrations/002_rls_policies.sql: enable RLS on all tables.
Doctors read/update own row. Patients readable by same-clinic doctors.
Sessions/Records CRUD for own doctor_id only.

Create /supabase/migrations/003_storage_buckets.sql: 'scan-images' bucket,
10MB max, scoped upload/read policies.
Mark Task 4.2 as DONE in PLAN.md.
```

#### Task 4.3 — Cloud Sync Service
```
Read PLAN.md. Implement Task 4.3:

Create /services/cloudSync.ts:
- uploadImage(record): upload COMPRESSED image to Storage at
  scan-images/{doctor_id}/{session_id}/{record_id}.jpg.
  Update Supabase records row with image_url. Update local SQLite:
  status='pending_extraction', synced_at=now.

- syncAllPending(): process sync_queue sequentially. On failure:
  retry_count++, max 5 retries then 'failed'. Return { synced, failed }.

- upsertSession(localSession): sync session to Supabase.

Create /services/backgroundSync.ts: startSyncWorker() listens to NetInfo.
On connectivity restored → syncAllPending(). Debounced, no duplicate runs.
Start in root _layout.tsx on launch.
Mark Task 4.3 as DONE in PLAN.md.
```

#### Task 4.4 — Patient Lookup
```
Read PLAN.md. Implement Task 4.4:

Create /services/patientService.ts:
- lookupPatient(code): online → Supabase query, offline → local SQLite.
- cachePatientLocally(patient): insert/update local patients table.
- registerPatient(code, name, dob, gender, clinicId): insert Supabase + cache.

Update QR flow: after scan → lookupPatient(code).
If found: show name, proceed. If not found: "New Patient" mini-form.
Mark Task 4.4 as DONE in PLAN.md.
```

